#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:4
msgid "v2.6.0"
msgstr "v2.6.0"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:6
msgid ""
"v2.6.0 updates the core to **MicroPython 1.9.2**, switches "
"``find_line_segments()`` to the **LSD** algorithm, adds **MT9V034 global-"
"shutter** sensor support, ``image.rotation_corr()`` perspective correction, "
":func:`sensor.sleep`, raw image saving, and OpenMV 4 board groundwork. "
"``find_line_segments()``, several framesizes, and MicroPython behavior "
"changed — read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v2.6.0 memperbarui inti ke **MicroPython 1.9.2**\\ , beralih "
"``find_line_segments()`` ke algoritma **LSD**\\ , menambahkan dukungan "
"sensor **MT9V034 global-shutter**\\ , koreksi perspektif "
"``image.rotation_corr()``\\ , :func:`sensor.sleep`\\ , penyimpanan citra "
"mentah, dan persiapan papan OpenMV 4. ``find_line_segments()``\\ , beberapa "
"ukuran bingkai, dan perilaku MicroPython berubah — baca perubahan yang "
"merusak di bawah ini."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:16
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Pada halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:19
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:21
msgid "**MicroPython 1.9.2** core update."
msgstr "Pembaruan inti **MicroPython 1.9.2**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:22
msgid ""
"**LSD line segments** — ``find_line_segments()`` now uses the Line Segment "
"Detector algorithm."
msgstr ""
"**Segmen garis LSD** — ``find_line_segments()`` kini menggunakan algoritma "
"Line Segment Detector."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:24
msgid "**MT9V034** global-shutter sensor support."
msgstr "Dukungan sensor global-shutter **MT9V034**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:25
msgid "``image.rotation_corr()`` — X/Y/Z perspective rotation correction."
msgstr "``image.rotation_corr()`` — koreksi rotasi perspektif X/Y/Z."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:26
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.sleep` soft sleep mode and raw (uncompressed) image saving."
msgstr ""
"Mode tidur halus :func:`sensor.sleep` dan penyimpanan citra mentah (tidak "
"terkompresi)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:27
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** ``find_line_segments()`` parameters, several framesize "
"constants, and MicroPython behavior changed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Merusak:** parameter ``find_line_segments()``\\ , beberapa konstanta "
"framesize, dan perilaku MicroPython berubah — lihat perubahan yang merusak."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:31
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Fitur baru"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:33
msgid ""
"``image.rotation_corr()`` — added X/Y/Z perspective rotation correction with"
" a ``rotation_correction.py`` example."
msgstr ""
"``image.rotation_corr()`` — ditambahkan koreksi rotasi perspektif X/Y/Z "
"dengan contoh ``rotation_correction.py``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:35
msgid ""
"``sensor.sleep(enable)`` — put the camera into a soft sleep mode (with a "
"sleep-mode example)."
msgstr ""
"``sensor.sleep(enable)`` — memasukkan kamera ke mode tidur halus (dengan "
"contoh mode tidur)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Raw images** — ``image.save()`` can now write raw (uncompressed) images."
msgstr ""
"**Citra mentah** — ``image.save()`` kini dapat menulis citra mentah (tidak "
"terkompresi)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:38
msgid ""
"**MT9V034** — added global-shutter sensor support, exposing the "
"``sensor.MT9V034`` constant."
msgstr ""
"**MT9V034** — ditambahkan dukungan sensor global-shutter, memunculkan "
"konstanta ``sensor.MT9V034``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:40
msgid ""
"Added a ``lens_correction.py`` example for ``image.lens_corr()`` and OpenMV "
"4 board support files (board config / bootloader / linker groundwork)."
msgstr ""
"Ditambahkan contoh ``lens_correction.py`` untuk ``image.lens_corr()`` dan "
"file dukungan papan OpenMV 4 (konfigurasi papan / bootloader / persiapan "
"linker)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:45
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Perubahan dan peningkatan lainnya"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:47
msgid ""
"Updated the bundled MicroPython to 1.9.2 (1.9 port plumbing, oofatfs); "
"rewrote ``find_line_segments.py`` for the new LSD API (lens correction off "
"by default); updated the host-side ``openmv`` API (``init(portname)`` / "
"``exec_script`` / ``stop_script``); lowered the OpenMV Cam M4 sensor clock "
"(lower max FPS on the M4); the IDE Stop button now uses a hard forced "
"exception to interrupt scripts more reliably."
msgstr ""
"Memperbarui MicroPython bundel ke 1.9.2 (plumbing port 1.9, oofatfs); "
"menulis ulang ``find_line_segments.py`` untuk API LSD baru (koreksi lensa "
"dinonaktifkan secara default); memperbarui API ``openmv`` sisi host (\\ "
"``init(portname)`` / ``exec_script`` / ``stop_script``\\ ); menurunkan clock"
" sensor OpenMV Cam M4 (FPS maks lebih rendah di M4); tombol Stop IDE kini "
"menggunakan pengecualian paksa keras untuk menginterupsi skrip dengan lebih "
"andal."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:55
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:57
msgid ""
"Fixed ``image.lens_corr()`` leaving stale pixels (the destination buffer is "
"now cleared before remapping), ``blob.density()`` using integer division "
"(always returned 0, #268), the OpenMV 2 (M4) UART pin mapping, and updated "
"``qrcodes_with_lens_corr.py`` to use QVGA."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki ``image.lens_corr()`` yang meninggalkan piksel basi (buffer "
"tujuan kini dibersihkan sebelum remapping), ``blob.density()`` menggunakan "
"pembagian integer (selalu mengembalikan 0, #268), pemetaan pin UART OpenMV 2"
" (M4), dan memperbarui ``qrcodes_with_lens_corr.py`` untuk menggunakan QVGA."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:63
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Dukungan hardware dan papan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:65
msgid "**MT9V034** global-shutter sensor."
msgstr "Sensor global-shutter **MT9V034**\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:66
msgid "**OpenMV 4** — board support files (groundwork)."
msgstr "**OpenMV 4** — file dukungan papan (persiapan)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:67
msgid "**OpenMV 2 (M4)** — UART pin-mapping fix."
msgstr "**OpenMV 2 (M4)** — perbaikan pemetaan pin UART."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:70
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang merusak"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:72
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v2.5.0 and v2.6.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan API yang terlihat pengguna antara v2.5.0 dan v2.6.0. Cakupan: "
"modul Python C di ``modules/`` dan pustaka Python di "
"``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:75
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Setiap perubahan diberi tag dampaknya:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:77
msgid ""
"*major* — affects most scripts that used the feature; you will need to port "
"code."
msgstr ""
"*major* — memengaruhi sebagian besar skrip yang menggunakan fitur tersebut; "
"Anda perlu melakukan porting kode."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:79
msgid "*minor* — narrow API; only affects scripts that used it."
msgstr "*minor* — API sempit; hanya memengaruhi skrip yang menggunakannya."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:80
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — API sama, hasil berbeda; periksa ulang skrip yang telah "
"disetel."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:82
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v2_6_0_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Perubahan dikelompokkan berdasarkan dampak dalam urutan tersebut. Jika Anda "
"hanya ingin melakukan porting kode, lompat ke :ref:`daftar periksa migrasi "
"<v2_6_0_migration>` di akhir. Setiap hash commit menautkan ke diff-nya di "
"GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:89
msgid "``find_line_segments()`` switched to LSD *(major)*"
msgstr "``find_line_segments()`` beralih ke LSD *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:91
msgid ""
"``image.find_line_segments()`` was rewritten to use the Line Segment "
"Detector (LSD) algorithm. The old ``threshold`` / ``theta_margin`` / "
"``rho_margin`` / ``segment_threshold`` / ``x_stride`` / ``y_stride`` "
"parameters were replaced with ``merge_distance`` and ``max_theta_diff`` "
"(e.g. ``find_line_segments(merge_distance=0, max_theta_diff=15)``). It is "
"also no longer available on M4-class (OpenMV 2) boards."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_line_segments()`` ditulis ulang untuk menggunakan algoritma "
"Line Segment Detector (LSD). Parameter lama ``threshold`` / ``theta_margin``"
" / ``rho_margin`` / ``segment_threshold`` / ``x_stride`` / ``y_stride`` "
"diganti dengan ``merge_distance`` dan ``max_theta_diff`` (mis. "
"``find_line_segments(merge_distance=0, max_theta_diff=15)``\\ ). Fungsi ini "
"juga tidak lagi tersedia pada papan kelas M4 (OpenMV 2)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:98
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `5a3153c8b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5a3153c8b>`__, `cbe2a4aeb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/cbe2a4aeb>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `5a3153c8b "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/5a3153c8b>`__\\ , `cbe2a4aeb "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/cbe2a4aeb>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:104
msgid "Invalid framesize constants removed *(minor)*"
msgstr "Konstanta framesize tidak valid dihapus *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"The invalid ``sensor.QQQQCIF`` / ``QQQCIF`` / ``QQQQSIF`` / ``QQQSIF`` / "
"``HQQQQVGA`` / ``HVGA`` framesize constants were removed (#261). Scripts "
"using these must switch to a supported resolution."
msgstr ""
"Konstanta framesize tidak valid ``sensor.QQQQCIF`` / ``QQQCIF`` / "
"``QQQQSIF`` / ``QQQSIF`` / ``HQQQQVGA`` / ``HVGA`` dihapus (#261). Skrip "
"yang menggunakan ini harus beralih ke resolusi yang didukung."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:110
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `35ab0a26f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/35ab0a26f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `35ab0a26f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/35ab0a26f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:115
msgid "``find_qrcodes()`` removed on the OpenMV Cam M4 *(minor)*"
msgstr "``find_qrcodes()`` dihapus pada OpenMV Cam M4 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"``image.find_qrcodes()`` is no longer compiled in on M4-class (OpenMV 2) "
"boards. Use an OpenMV 3 (M7) board or another code feature for QR detection "
"on M4 hardware. Other boards are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_qrcodes()`` tidak lagi dikompilasi pada papan kelas M4 (OpenMV "
"2). Gunakan papan OpenMV 3 (M7) atau fitur kode lain untuk deteksi QR pada "
"hardware M4. Papan lain tidak terpengaruh."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:121
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7dff089e6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7dff089e6>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `7dff089e6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7dff089e6>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:126
msgid "MicroPython updated to 1.9.2 *(behavior)*"
msgstr "MicroPython diperbarui ke 1.9.2 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:128
msgid ""
"The bundled MicroPython core was updated to 1.9.2. Standard-library and "
"language behavior follows upstream MicroPython 1.9.2 — re-check scripts that"
" depend on version-specific behavior. Notably, an image slice with a step "
"other than 1 now raises ``OSError`` instead of ``NotImplementedError``."
msgstr ""
"Inti MicroPython bundel diperbarui ke 1.9.2. Perilaku pustaka standar dan "
"bahasa mengikuti MicroPython upstream 1.9.2 — periksa ulang skrip yang "
"bergantung pada perilaku spesifik versi. Khususnya, slice citra dengan "
"langkah selain 1 kini menampilkan ``OSError`` alih-alih "
"``NotImplementedError``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:133
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `11bed4b99 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/11bed4b99>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `11bed4b99 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/11bed4b99>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:138
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Daftar periksa migrasi"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:140
msgid "For a clean port to v2.6.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Untuk porting bersih ke v2.6.0, pekerjaan tipikal adalah:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:142
msgid ""
"Rewrite ``find_line_segments()`` calls for the LSD parameters "
"(``merge_distance`` / ``max_theta_diff``) and move that processing off the "
"M4 (:ref:`the LSD rework <v2_6_0_lsd>`)."
msgstr ""
"Tulis ulang pemanggilan ``find_line_segments()`` untuk parameter LSD (\\ "
"``merge_distance`` / ``max_theta_diff``\\ ) dan pindahkan pemrosesan "
"tersebut dari M4 (\\ :ref:`pembaruan LSD <v2_6_0_lsd>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:145
msgid ""
"Replace removed framesize constants with a supported resolution (:ref:`the "
"framesize removal <v2_6_0_framesizes>`)."
msgstr ""
"Ganti konstanta framesize yang dihapus dengan resolusi yang didukung (\\ "
":ref:`penghapusan framesize <v2_6_0_framesizes>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:147
msgid ""
"Move M4 QR-code detection to an M7 board (:ref:`the find_qrcodes change "
"<v2_6_0_qrcodes>`)."
msgstr ""
"Pindahkan deteksi kode QR M4 ke papan M7 (\\ :ref:`perubahan find_qrcodes "
"<v2_6_0_qrcodes>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:149
msgid ""
"Re-validate version-specific behavior against MicroPython 1.9.2 (:ref:`the "
"MicroPython bump <v2_6_0_micropython>`)."
msgstr ""
"Validasi ulang perilaku spesifik versi terhadap MicroPython 1.9.2 (\\ "
":ref:`peningkatan MicroPython <v2_6_0_micropython>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:152
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Semua skrip lainnya berjalan tanpa perubahan."
